{"ticker":"544786","symbol":"544786","instrumentId":3202709,"name":"Schneider Elec. Pre.","industry":"BSE-Telecom-Infrastructure","about":"\"Schneider Electric President Systems designs, manufactures, and supplies standard as well as customized enclosure systems used in IT and telecom infrastructure. Its product portfolio includes server and networking racks, enclosures, card frames, components, and related accessories.\n\nThe company operates through the enclosure systems and electrical equipment businesses. Its solutions help customers manage critical IT equipment, optimize space utilization, improve airflow management, and integrate power infrastructure efficiently.\n\nIts products are used across IT and networking, IT-enabled services, telecom, general electronics, and industrial electronics sectors. The company primarily serves customers in India, supporting enterprise, telecom, and technology infrastructure requirements.\"","website":"www.schneiderelectricpresident.com","location":null,"exchange":"BSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:56:21.669Z","basis":"standalone","price":{"value":1251.3,"changePct":-1.1025489033787825,"week52High":2589.3,"week52Low":0},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹1,514 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹386 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"3,144,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"2"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"16,143"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.00%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"6.37"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"0.6"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"—"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0.47"},{"label":"Beta","value":"0.34"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"19%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"49.3"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"44–107"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"15.9%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"31.76"},{"label":"Volume","value":"12,069"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"6,835"},{"label":"Master score","value":"36"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"2